{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_055","slug":"fr2016-055-five","title":{"native":"Five","english":"Five"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-03-30","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Igor Gotesman","slug":"igor-gotesman","name":"Igor Gotesman","birthYear":1986,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/1/101/156929/format_page/five.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Lij2vKRCBc"},"synopsis":{"native":"Cinq amis d'enfance rêvent depuis toujours d'habiter en colocation. Lorsque l’occasion d’emménager ensemble se présente, Julia, Vadim, Nestor et Timothée n’hésitent pas une seule seconde, surtout quand Samuel se propose de payer la moitié du loyer ! A peine installés, Samuel se retrouve sur la paille mais décide de ne rien dire aux autres et d'assumer sa part en se mettant à vendre de l'herbe. Mais n'est pas dealer qui veut et quand tout dégénère, Samuel n’a d’autres choix que de se tourner vers la seule famille qu'il lui reste : ses amis !","english":"Five childhood friends have always dreamed of sharing an apartment together. When the opportunity arises, Julia, Vadim, Nestor, and Timothée don't hesitate a single instant, particularly when Samuel offers to pay half the rent! They've barely moved in when Samuel finds himself without a dime, but he decides to say nothing to the others and to stick to their deal by selling grass. But you can't become a dealer just like that and when everything goes AWOL, Samuel has no other choice but to turn to the only family he has left: his friends."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Bruno Lochet","slug":"bruno-lochet","name":"Bruno Lochet","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Fanny Ardant","slug"